  "name": "smilodon",
  "_about": "Smilodon fatalis SCULPTED on the cat frame (2026-11-05, gen: scratchpad sc/carn/gen/smilodon.py from the tiger's shapes): a bear-cat -- massive neck and forelimbs, a short loin, the hindquarters lower than the shoulder, a bob tail; a short tall face over a deep chin, and the sabres (rounded blades, 2:1 oval in section, behind the whisker pad, curving back) reaching past its flange; tawny, paler beneath (2026-11-08, ears2.py) The EARS (ears2.py): small round cupped sheets (sharp.js `fin`), cream in the hollow; the roots faired. WHISKERS (2026-11-08, tools/creaturegen/sharp/whiskers.py): 16 white whiskers a side, 4 rows on the whisker pad (125-187 mm); 3 white whiskers a side, a brow tuft (46-62 mm) -- `whiskers` shapes (bodyspec.js whiskerStrands: thin pointed strands, mirrored, on the head, near mesh only; details, so every coat and variant still shares one mesh).",
